es the amount of pantothenic acid (vitamin B5) consumed.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  dietaryPhosphorus<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-dietaryPhosphorus\"> </a></td><td>Phosphorus</td><td>A quantity sample type that measures the amount of phosphorus consumed.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  dietaryPotassium<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-dietaryPotassium\"> </a></td><td>Potassium</td><td>A quantity sample type that measures the amount of potassium consumed.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  dietaryProtein<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-dietaryProtein\"> </a></td><td>Protein</td><td>A quantity sample type that measures the amount of protein consumed.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  dietaryRiboflavin<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-dietaryRiboflavin\"> </a></td><td>Riboflavin</td><td>A quantity sample type that measures the amount of riboflavin (vitamin B2) consumed.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  dietarySelenium<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-dietarySelenium\"> </a></td><td>Selenium</td><td>A quantity sample type that measures the amount of selenium consumed.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  dietarySodium<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-dietarySodium\"> </a></td><td>Sodium</td><td>A quantity sample type that measures the amount of sodium consumed.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  dietarySugar<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-dietarySugar\"> </a></td><td>Sugar</td><td>A quantity sample type that measures the amount of sugar consumed.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  dietaryThiamin<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-dietaryThiamin\"> </a></td><td>Thiamin</td><td>A quantity sample type that measures the amount of thiamin (vitamin B1) consumed.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  dietaryVitaminA<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-dietaryVitaminA\"> 