tiveHealth<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-ReproductiveHealth\"> </a></td><td>Reproductive health</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  basalBodyTemperature<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-basalBodyTemperature\"> </a></td><td>Basal body temperature</td><td>A quantity sample type that records the user's basal body temperature.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  cervicalMucusQuality<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-cervicalMucusQuality\"> </a></td><td>Cervical mucus quality</td><td>A category sample type that records the quality of the user's cervical mucus.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  contraceptive<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-contraceptive\"> </a></td><td>Contraceptive</td><td>A category sample type that records the use of contraceptives.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  intermenstrualBleeding<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-intermenstrualBleeding\"> </a></td><td>Intermenstrual bleeding</td><td>A category sample type that records spotting outside the normal menstruation period.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  irregularMenstrualCycles<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-irregularMenstrualCycles\"> </a></td><td>Irregular menstrual cycles</td><td>A category sample that indicates an irregular menstrual cycle.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  infrequentMenstrualCycles<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-infrequentMenstrualCycles\"> </a></td><td>Infrequent menstrual cycles</td><td>A category sample that indicates an infrequent menstrual cycle.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  lactation<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-lactation\"> </a></td><td>Lactation</td><td>A category type that records lactation.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  menstrualFlow<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-menstrualFlow\"> </a></td><td>Menstrual flow</td><td>A category sample type that records menstrual cyc