 style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  doubleArmTricepsExtension<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-doubleArmTricepsExtension\"> </a></td><td>Double arm triceps extension</td><td>The constant for triceps extension exercises using both arms.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  dumbbellRow<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-dumbbellRow\"> </a></td><td>Dumbbell row</td><td>The constant for back-strengthening exercises using dumbbells.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  frontRaise<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-frontRaise\"> </a></td><td>Front raise</td><td>The constant for shoulder workouts lifting weights in front of the body.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  hipThrust<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-hipThrust\"> </a></td><td>Hip thrust</td><td>The constant for glute-focused exercises involving hip elevation.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  hulaHoop<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-hulaHoop\"> </a></td><td>Hula hoop</td><td>The constant for core and cardio workouts using a hula hoop.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  kettlebellSwing<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-kettlebellSwing\"> </a></td><td>Kettlebell swing</td><td>The constant for dynamic full-body workouts using a kettlebell.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  lateralRaise<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-lateralRaise\"> </a></td><td>Lateral raise</td><td>The constant for shoulder workouts lifting weights to the sides.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  legCurl<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-legCurl\"> </a></td><td>Leg curl</td><td>The constant for hamstring-focused leg curl exercises.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  legExtension<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-legExtension\"> </a></td><td>Leg extension</td><td>The constant for quadriceps-focused leg extension exercises.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  legPress<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-legPress\"> </a></td><td>Leg press</td><td>The constant for lower-body strength training using a leg press machine.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  legRaise<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-legRaise\"> </a></td><td>Leg raise</td><td>The constant for abdominal and hip flexor exercises involving leg lifts.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  mountainClimber<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-mountainClimber\"> </a></td><td>Mountain climber</td><td>The constant for cardio and core workouts simulating climbing motion.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  otherWorkout<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-otherWorkout\"> </a></td><td>Other workout</td><td>The constant for workouts not categorized under specific types.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  pause<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-pause\"> </a></td><td>Pause</td><td>The constant for temporary pauses during a workout session.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  pullUp<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-pullUp\"> </a></td><td>Pull-up</td><td>The constant for upper-body strength exercises involving pulling up the body.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  punch<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-punch\"> </a></td><td>Punch</td><td>The constant for boxing-style workouts involving punching motions.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  rest<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-rest\"> </a></td><td>Rest</td><td>The constant for rest periods between or after workouts.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  shoulderPress<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-shoulderPress\"> </a></td><td>Shoulder press</td><td>The constant for overhead pressing exercises targeting the shoulders.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  singleArmTricepsExtension<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-singleArmTricepsExtension\"> </a></td><td>Single arm triceps extension</td><td>The constant for triceps extension exercises using one arm.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  sitUp<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-sitUp\"> </a></td><td>Sit-up</td><td>The constant for abdominal exercises involving torso lifts.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  stairClimbingMachine<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-stairClimbingMachine\"> </a></td><td>Stair climbing</td><td>The constant for workouts using a stair climbing machine.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  swimmingBackstroke<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-swimmingBackstroke\"> </a></td><td>Swimming backstroke</td><td>The constant for swimming using the backstroke technique.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  swimmingBreaststroke<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-swimmingBreaststroke\"> </a></td><td>Swimming breaststroke</td><td>The constant for swimming using the breaststroke technique.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  swimmingButterfly<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-swimmingButterfly\"> </a></td><td>Swimming butterfly</td><td>The constant for swimming using the butterfly stroke.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  swimmingFreestyle<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-swimmingFreestyle\"> </a></td><td>Swimming freestyle</td><td>The constant for swimming using the freestyle stroke.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  swimmingMixed<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-swimmingMixed\"> </a></td><td>Swimming mixed</td><td>The constant for swimming using a combination of strokes.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  swimmingOther<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-swimmingOther\"> </a></td><td>Swimming other</td><td>The constant for swimming using other or unspecified techniques.</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Audiogram<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-Audiogram\"> </a></td><td>Audiogram</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  hearingSensitivity<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-hearingSensitivity\"> </a></td><td>Hearing sensitivity</td><td>A pair of frequencies and left/right ear sensitivity data to represent the patient's hearing sensitivity for each frequency.</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">food<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-food\"> </a></td><td>Food</td><td/></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">medicationAdherence<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-medicationAdherence\"> </a></td><td>Medication adherence</td><td>The degree to which a patient correctly follows medical advice, particularly in relation to taking prescribed medication.</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Mind<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-Mind\"> </a></td><td>Mind</td><td/></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  stateOfMind<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-stateOfMind\"> </a></td><td>State of Mind</td><td>Momentary emotions and daily moods.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  gad7<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-gad7\"> </a></td><td>GAD-7 assessment</td><td>The Generalized Anxiety Disorder 7-item scale.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  phq9<a name=\"observation-pghd-codes-phq9\"> </a></td><td>PHQ-9 assessment</td><td>The nine-item Patient Health Questionnaire.</td></tr></table></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
